WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.510
- You guys just look like
you're having so much fun

00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:05.130
in your engagement.

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:07.820
Are you guys enjoying it as much

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:10.770
as we feel it and see it?

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:12.090
- Yes.
- Yeah, we are.

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:15.050
- And we're so thrilled to
be on the cover of The Knot.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:18.040
And talking about it here on
your show, Drew, our show,

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:19.560
because it's important to us

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:20.710
to share our love

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:21.543
with the world.
- Yeah.

00:00:21.543 --> 00:00:23.060
And we made a conscious decision

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:24.880
to do that because why?

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:27.100
- [Wellinthon] Well, because
growing up an immigrant

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.340
from Dominican Republic and
him being a little farm boy

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:32.400
from Mount Vernon we never saw that.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.720
And it's important to actually
have that representation

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:37.840
out there and just value that anyone

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:38.711
can actually have that

00:00:38.711 --> 00:00:40.413
as well, so excited.
- Yeah.

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:42.520
- Growing up, think about that.

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:44.120
We didn't even know.

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:44.953
We didn't even dream

00:00:44.953 --> 00:00:46.070
about getting married one day.
- No.

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:48.590
Because it wasn't even an option for us.

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:51.060
And so we think by sharing our love story

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:52.500
and showing it to everyone

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:53.540
maybe there's a little kid out there

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:56.870
who can look at us and go,
"Oh my God, I deserve that.

00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:58.053
I deserve love."

